  "solution": "**Given:**\n\na × b = a + b + ( sqrt {(a)/(b)} ) + sqrt {(ab)} \n\n**Formula used:**\n\na × b = a + b + (√(a/b)) + √(ab)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nLet a = 16 and b = 4.\n\n⇒ 16 + 4 + √(16/4) + √(16×4)\n\n⇒ 16 + 4 + √4 + √64\n\n⇒ 16 + 4 + 2 + 8\n\n⇒ 30\n\n**∴ The value of 16 × 4 is 30.**",
